~ start
Template Elder: [[Hi|Hello|Greetings]]! We've been waiting for you. Our world is full of stories!
Template Elder: We have some StoryQuest templates for you to explore. These stories are yours to adapt and make your own!
do balloon.hide()
do show_storybook()
if chosen_quest == null:
	% Template Elder: No rush! Take your time and feel free to check back whenever you're ready.
	% Template Elder: Whenever you're curious, come back and take a look at the templates!
else:
	Template Elder: Explore the template, adapt the story, and see where the path leads.
=> END
~ go_to_loom
Template Elder: Go on, StoryWeaver: take the threads to the Eternal Loom.
=> END
~ threads_incorporated
Template Elder: Thank you, StoryWeaver! The fabric of the world slowly heals!
Template Elder: Go forth: our world still needs your help.
=> END
~ no_quests
Template Elder: I don't have any quests for you. Talk to my fellow Elders.
=> END
